<h1>Support the archive</h1>
<p class="updated">ArtCard.LA is a finished public archive of postcards mailed from 2009–2015. Submissions are closed. The site is maintained as a non-commercial record of Los Angeles mail art. If you’d like to help keep the archive online, you can support it here.</p>
<p>One-time and monthly support are both welcome. Support is handled on Ko-fi.</p>
